  },
  data: {
    LLM: "On your turn play one card matching the top card's suit or number, or play a Whot and name a suit. If you cannot or do not wish to play, draw one card from the stock (you may not play after drawing that turn). Nigerian specials: 1 Hold On (play again), 2 Pick Two, 5 Pick Three, 8 Suspension (skip next; Star 8 skips two), 14 General Market (all others draw one). Say semi-last card and last card; say check up when playing last card or draw two as penalty.",
    Player: "On your turn play one card matching the top card's suit or number, or play a Whot and name a suit. If you cannot or do not wish to play, draw one card from the stock (you may not play after drawing that turn). Nigerian specials: 1 Hold On (play again), 2 Pick Two, 5 Pick Three, 8 Suspension (skip next; Star 8 skips two), 14 General Market (all others draw one). Say semi-last card and last card; say check up when playing last card or draw two as penalty.",
    objective: 'Be the first to get rid of all your cards. Others score penalty points for cards left in hand; players with 100 or more drop out; last player left wins.',
    gameplay: "On your turn play one card matching the top card's suit or number, or play a Whot and name a suit. If you cannot or do not wish to play, draw one card from the stock (you may not play after drawing that turn). Nigerian specials: 1 Hold On (play again), 2 Pick Two, 5 Pick Three, 8 Suspension (skip next; Star 8 skips two), 14 General Market (all others draw one). Say semi-last card and last card; say check up when playing last card or draw two as penalty.",
    keyRules: [
      'Match suit or number of the top card, or play Whot and name a suit',
      'If you cannot or do not wish to play, draw one from stock; you may not play after drawing that turn',
      'When stock is empty, shuffle all but the top card of the play pile to form a new stock',
      'First to empty hand wins; others score penalty points; 100+ drops out',
