    turnFlow: "On your turn play one card matching the top card's suit or number, or play a Whot and name a suit. If you cannot or do not wish to play, draw one card from the stock (you may not play after drawing that turn). Nigerian specials: 1 Hold On (play again), 2 Pick Two, 5 Pick Three, 8 Suspension (skip next; Star 8 skips two), 14 General Market (all others draw one). Say semi-last card and last card; say check up when playing last card or draw two as penalty.",
